{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/108016-book-layout","id":108016,"title":"Book Layout","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-08T00:20:24-07:00","id":108016,"title":"Book Layout","content":"Hi,<br /> <br /> I flicked through the quickstart from the free bundle on DTRPG and found the layout...insufferable. Is the Aeon/Trinity/Abberant/Adventure!/Weaselwigglers/misc title here/etc. going to use that same style of layout? The pages felt cluttered and the bells and whistles very distracting and it seemed like each page wasted a huge amount of space on borders and the like.<br /> <br /> I know it's going ot have new art, new layout, etc. but will it be done in the same style or will a newer, less...cluttered...style be used?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-08T07:12:14-07:00","id":108178,"title":"","content":"This may be a case of media type getting in the way. The layout works great in print. NOTE: it has been years since I looked at the quickstart PDF. My previous comment considers the Trinity core book, which as I recall, has similar layout.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6-slagheap","name":"Slagheap","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-08T08:50:23-07:00","id":108230,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/gs_flipbook/flip.php?xml=/demo_xml/86000.xml&amp;w=500&amp;h=357\" target=\"_blank\">http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/gs_fli...ml&amp;w=500&amp;h=357</a><br /> <br /> Page 5 in particular here feels...very busy, the frame for the page comibed with the small print makes it feel a bit cluttered.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-08T09:05:21-07:00","id":108245,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scutarii</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/108016-book-layout#post108016\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi,<br /> <br /> I flicked through the quickstart from the free bundle on DTRPG and found the layout...insufferable. Is the Aeon/Trinity/Abberant/Adventure!/Weaselwigglers/misc title here/etc. going to use that same style of layout? The pages felt cluttered and the bells and whistles very distracting and it seemed like each page wasted a huge amount of space on borders and the like.<br /> <br /> I know it's going ot have new art, new layout, etc. but will it be done in the same style or will a newer, less...cluttered...style be used?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, that's media layout.<br /> <br /> Also, like, what? 15-year-old layout, at this point? C'mon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-08T09:22:15-07:00","id":108252,"title":"","content":"Sure, but I've never seen a layout that...aggressively unpleasant...before and I know nothing about Trinity so don;t know if there's some kind of iconic style it uses.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-08T13:33:00-07:00","id":108514,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scutarii</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/108016-book-layout?p=108252#post108252\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sure, but I've never seen a layout that...aggressively unpleasant...before and I know nothing about Trinity so don;t know if there's some kind of iconic style it uses.</div> </div> </div> </div>Odds that we would continue using a style from 17 years ago are slim.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}